      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Cheered up by this news, biologists, in their turn, began to do some research to remove people’s puzzles — Now that there are some suitable conditions, does life really exist on this globe? Do they multiply by laying eggs or giving birth to babies? Last month, a spaceship was sent there.",
        "zh": "受到这个消息的鼓舞，接着轮到生物学家，开始开展研究，解答人们的疑问，——既然已经存在一些适宜的条件，这个星球上真的有生命吗？它们是产卵繁殖，还是生下幼崽？上个月，一艘宇宙飞船被派往那里。",
